      "skill_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">After you <span class=\"fontstyle2\">plant a magiseed </span>through the <span class=\"fontstyle2\">Chloromancy </span>Skill (not when using <span class=\"fontstyle2\">Graft</span>), you may choose one option: </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">1.you perform a <span class=\"fontstyle2\">free attack </span>with an equipped weapon<span class=\"fontstyle2\"><br></span>2.you immediately perform the <span class=\"fontstyle2\">Spell </span>action for free, casting a spell with a <span class=\"fontstyle2\">total Mind Point cost equal to or lower than</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">5 + (SL &times; 5)</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】 </span>(you must still pay its MP cost). </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Treat the <span class=\"fontstyle2\">High Roll (HR) </span>of your Accuracy Check or Magic Check as being equal to 0 when determining damage dealt by this attack or spell <br></span></p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "BATTLE GARDENING"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Each time you acquire this Skill, you discover </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">a new type of magiseed</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">. The rules for </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">discovering magiseeds </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">can be found in the next pages.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br>During a conflict, if there are </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">no magiseeds </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">in your </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">garden</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, you may use an action and spend 20 Mind Points to </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">plant a magiseed </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">among those you have discovered.&nbsp;</span></p>",
          "level": "8",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "CHLOROMANCY"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<p>1&nbsp; <span class=\"fontstyle0\">At the end of your turn, you and every ally you can see recover from </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">dazed</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">enraged</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, and </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">shaken</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.</span> </p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">2-3 At the end of your turn, you and every ally you can see recover an amount of<br>Mind Points equal to<span class=\"fontstyle2\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">5 + your Skill Level in Chloromancy</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">】(13)</span><br></span></p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Seed : GOLDEN GINKGO"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"550\">\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">At the end of your turn, you and every ally you can see recover from </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">poisoned</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">,<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">slow</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">, and </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">weak</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle2\"><br></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">2-3 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">At the end of your turn, you and every ally you can see recover an amount of Hit Points equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">15 + your Skill Level in Chloromancy</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】(23)</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Seed : REMEDY LILY"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">0-1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">You are Resistant to </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">earth </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">and </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">ice </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage.<br></span></p>\n<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"550\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\">2-3 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">You and your allies present on the scene are Resistant to </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">earth </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">and </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">ice </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Seed : ARCTIC NARCISSUS"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"430\">\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">0-1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">All damage you deal becomes </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">poison</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">, its type cannot change, and it ignores<br>Immunities and Resistances.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle2\"><br></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">2-3 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">All damage you deal becomes </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">poison</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">, its type cannot change, and it ignores<br>Immunities and Resistances. Additionally, when you deal </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">poison </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage for the<br>first time during your turn, you deal extra damage equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">your Skill Level in<br>Chloromancy</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】(8 ) </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">and each creature that lost Hit Points this way suffers [</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">poisoned]</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Seed : HOOKLEAF NIGHTSHADE"
        },
        "6": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">1-2 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">At the end of your turn, choose yourself </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">or </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">another Player Character you can see. The chosen character regains 2 Inventory Point.<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"NormalTable\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 34px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 34px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 115.063%; height: 34px;\" width=\"550\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\">3 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">At the end of your turn, you </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">and </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">every other Player Character you can see regain 1 Inventory Point</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Seed : PILGRIM GAZALIA"
        },
        "7": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Seed : BLAZING CHRYSANTHEMUM"
        },
        "8": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"550\">\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">At the end of your turn, you may choose an enemy you can see. If you do, that<br>enemy suffers </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">slow</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle2\"><br></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">2 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">At the end of your turn, every enemy you can see suffers </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">slow</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle2\"><br></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">3 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">At the end of your turn, you deal an amount of </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">physical </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">15 + your Skill Level in Chloromancy</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】(23) </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">to each enemy you can see who is suffering from </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">slow</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Seed : SERRATED ROSE"
        },
        "9": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">0-1 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">You are Resistant to </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">physical </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage.<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"NormalTable\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"430\">\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">2 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">You are Resistant to </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">physical </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage. Additionally, after a creature </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">hits </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">you with a </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">melee </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">attack, you deal an amount of </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">physical </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage to that creature equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">5 + your Skill Level in Chloromancy</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】(13) </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">(after their attack was resolved).</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle2\"><br></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">3 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">You are Resistant to </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">physical </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage. Additionally, after a creature </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">hits </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">you with a </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">melee </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">attack, you deal an amount of </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">physical </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage to that creature equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">5 + your Skill Level in Chloromancy</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】(13)</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">, and then deal an amount of </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">poison </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">damage to that creature equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">5 + your Skill Level in Chloromancy</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】(13) </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">(both these damage instances happen after that creature's attack was resolved)</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Seed : WARDWATTLE"
        },
        "10": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Floralist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">As long as there is a </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">magiseed </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">in your </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">garden </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">and </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">1 or more sections </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">of your </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Growth Clock </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">are </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">filled</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, you may use an action to </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">remove </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">that </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">magiseed </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">from your </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">garden</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">: if you do, you immediately </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">plant a different magiseed </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">among those you have discovered (keep the current filled sections of your Growth Clock unchanged).</span> </p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "GRAFT"
        },
        "11": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Commander",
